title: Leadership Elections of the S&D
new-page: true
subtitle: The elections of the Socialists and Democrats, deciding the course of the party.
tags: event
view-if: year == 2069 and month == 1
max-visits: 1

= Leadership Elections of the S&D

The party will finally hold elections. One of the factions will take control, but whom?
  
- @elections: Let's see the results, then.
- @noelections: How about we don't.

@elections
on-arrival: resources += 1

The results are in.

- @girondinsvictory: The Girondins Win!
- @neodemocratvictory: The Neodemocrats Win!
- @redistributorvictory: The Redistributors Win!
- @regulationistvictory: The Regulationists Win!
- @leftconsvictory: The Left Conservatives Win!

@girondinsvictory  
choose-if: girondins_strength > neodemocrat_strength and girondins_strength > redistributor_strength and girondins_strength > regulationist_strength and girondins_strength > leftcons_strength

The Girondins win! Meanwhile, the accelerationists send us a pretty obscure meme with a sentence on it. 
- @ultraleftgirondins: We are no longer revolutionaries.
  
@ultraleftgirondins

Brissot Unimpressed.

@neodemocratvictory
choose-if: neodemocrat_strength > girondins_strength and neodemocrat_strength > redistributor_strength and neodemocrat_strength > regulationist_strength and neodemocrat_strength > leftcons_strength

The Neodemocrats win! A couple days later, the accelerationists send a weird.. meme. 

- @ultraleftneodemocrats: You too, will become social democrats.

@ultraleftneodemocrats  
  
Total Lassalle Victory, Indeed!

@redistributorvictory
choose-if: redistributor_strength > girondins_strength and redistributor_strength > neodemocrat_strength and redistributor_strength > regulationist_strength and redistributor_strength > leftcons_strength

The Redistributors win! At that exact moment, the screen behind our new leader suddenly shows a new meme.

- @ultraleftredistributor: Today, Social Democracy is Born.

@ultraleftredistributor

???

@regulationistvictory
choose-if: regulationist_strength > girondins_strength and regulationist_strength > neodemocrat_strength and regulationist_strength > redistributor_strength and regulationist_strength > leftcons_strength

The regulationists win! After the celebrations calmed down, a hidden speaker suddenly spew out a random piece of dialogue.

- @ultraleftregulationist: Our only doctrine is LARP!

@ultraleftregulationist

2 minutes later, our security guard was holding his belongings and promptly left the building.

@leftconsvictory
choose-if: leftcons_strength > girondins_strength and leftcons_strength > neodemocrat_strength and leftcons_strength > redistributor_strength and leftcons_strength > regulationist_strength

The left conservatives surprisingly win! After a day or two, the accelerationist leader proceeded to publish a short message about us on EuroTube, and it ended with...

- @ultraleftleftcons: The Ridiculous Prevails...

@ultraleftleftcons

Can someone block those accelerationists already?!
  
@noelections
choose-if:  year == 1933
unavailable-subtitle: We're not a dictatorship.

The Jewish capitalist world will not survive the twentieth century - Adolf Hitler. Ok haha you looked at the code, now stop cheating.
